WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:29.920
﻿The Buff Clan's Dron cooperated with
 Commodore of Ajian to take hostages.

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:36.310
﻿However, ﻿their plan was unsuccessful,

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:39.150
and only resulted in more victims.

00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:44.580
﻿Wherever the Solo Ship goes, it only brings
 forth misunderstandings and treachery.

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:48.870
﻿Is the power of good beyond humanity's grasp?

00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:55.830
<b>The Space Runaway</b>

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:13.680
﻿Can you compare space coordinates
 in our current situation, Joliver?

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:14.690
Should be possible.

00:02:16.230 --> 00:02:19.010
These are all space charts
 centered on the Solo Ship...

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:21.100
You managed to gather this many?

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:22.780
﻿I've got it!

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:25.640
﻿This is a chart of the entire universe
 centered on the Solo Ship.

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:33.210
So those glowing red lights
﻿are the Buff Clan's warships?

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:35.380
They're not stars, that's for sure.

00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:37.160
We did it, Joliver!

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:39.750
This works better than expected!

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:44.290
﻿Yeah, connecting our radar into the
 Ide's energy system was worth it.

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:45.890
﻿But...

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:49.690
These spots are over 500,000 light years away...

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:52.960
Can we really trust this radar?

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:54.150
﻿I wonder...

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:56.900
The bio-transmitters are toys compared to this.

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:57.920
That's right.

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:00.030
﻿Those only pinpoint the location.

00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:03.280
﻿I'll magnify this red spot from
500,000 light years away.

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:05.400
﻿Let's see if we can display it.

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:08.870
﻿Magnify!

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:17.110
The Buff Clan... Are you certain?

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:19.460
The coordinate axis is stabilized.

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:21.220
﻿This is a real image.

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:24.260
﻿Is it the Buff Clan again?

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:27.730
﻿No, this is an image from 500,000 light years away.

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:29.680
﻿That thing there?

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:31.940
They're using the Ide energy.

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:32.980
﻿The Ide's power?

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:37.400
If we get surrounded, they seem to be
 weakest ﻿at the direction of 4 o'clock.

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:38.440
Enemy attack!

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:39.110
﻿What?!

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:41.570
Looks like the Ide radar has
 trouble picking up nearby ﻿objects!

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:42.030
I'm going!

00:03:42.650 --> 00:03:43.700
﻿It's a Buff Clan fleet!

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:44.750
There's plenty of them!

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:46.290
﻿Go into DS Drive!

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:47.580
We'll shake them off!

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:48.330
﻿Roger!

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:51.140
﻿Engine one, ﻿engine two, start!

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:58.290
﻿Start the anti-matter engine!

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:12.230
﻿The Logo Dau Aliens' ship has
﻿entered subspace flight!

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:13.690
﻿What about the tracking device?

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:15.440
There's not one attached...

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:17.900
Can you search for space-time distortions?

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:20.280
﻿We should be able to find
﻿the Logo Dau ship that way.

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:22.690
If the results only were more accurate...

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:24.150
Don't ask for the impossible.

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:28.280
It's good enough if we get
 2.5 light years closer to them.

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:35.730
I should have removed every
 transmitter from the Solo Ship, but...

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:38.200
The enemy can still accurately pursue us.

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:40.000
That's odd...

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:41.080
﻿Why do you think it's so?

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:44.560
Do you think questioning us will help?

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:45.630
Yes.

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:49.400
If I figure it out, it'll help us fight better.

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:50.450
I suppose so.

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:53.360
What could be the cause of this?

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:54.680
It's the Ide.

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:55.760
The Ide's power!

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:56.730
I see.

00:04:57.150 --> 00:05:00.500
﻿The stronger the Ide's power
 becomes, ﻿the easier it is to detect!

00:05:00.770 --> 00:05:01.820
Enemy units ahead!

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:02.420
﻿What?!

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:06.780
It's like Gije said!

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:08.620
﻿Should we take off?

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:10.580
﻿The Ideo-Buster will take the lead!

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:11.080
﻿Roger!

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:21.670
We'll aim for their mothership, okay?

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:22.670
Is that safe?

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:23.630
Leave it to me!

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:30.070
Don't stray off course in subspace flight!

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:32.010
﻿We might get separated from the others!

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:34.640
We're orphans of space either way.

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:35.270
﻿But...!

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:40.480
Kasha came up with a good strategy.

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:42.980
﻿Deck, keep an eye on the subspace gauge.

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:44.070
﻿Roger!

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:46.600
﻿We're fine as long as we don't
cross these lines on the left and right.

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:49.570
Here they come!

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:57.350
﻿Okay! We'll shift the Ideo-Nova's coordinates too!

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:58.870
Don't overdo it!

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:00.400
I'm quite used to this.

00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:04.670
﻿They're coming!

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:05.660
﻿Fire the main cannon!

00:06:12.150 --> 00:06:14.350
﻿Great! We got four of them at once!

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:15.890
﻿Where's Kasha's Ideo-Buster?

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:18.180
﻿She's approaching the enemy ship!

00:06:18.180 --> 00:06:18.930
Can she make it?

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:22.110
﻿It's just one vessel!

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:42.640
I don't quite understand...

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:47.260
It looks like the Logo Dau ship is heading
 where our encirclement is the weakest.

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:49.130
How do they know?

00:06:49.670 --> 00:06:51.550
If I knew, I wouldn't be troubled.

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:53.390
﻿Get Kodomon Muron on the monitor.

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:54.100
﻿Yes...

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:56.470
﻿It's Kodomon.

00:06:57.350 --> 00:07:00.440
﻿My fleet is the closest to the Logo Dau aliens.

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:01.930
﻿Kodomon, I want your team to stop them.

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:04.080
﻿Understood, ma'am!

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:06.690
We got orders to sortie!

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:07.970
﻿Prepare to launch!

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:10.110
We might be old men...

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:13.200
But this is our chance to show
 that we won't lose to the young!

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:14.030
Listen up!

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:18.850
While Lady Harulu calls for reinforcements,
 wear down the enemy as much you can!

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:29.220
I've never seen a planet like this...

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:30.550
How is it?

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:32.420
We shook them off for now.

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:35.390
But if they return, we'd better strike first.

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:37.290
This time we can do it!

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:39.510
You seem confident.

00:07:39.510 --> 00:07:44.230
Yeah, the Ide radar system I set up
 with Joliver does good work.

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:47.400
Let's discuss this further after a break.

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.860
I haven't had a wink of sleep since Ajian.

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:51.190
﻿Yeah, let's do that.

00:07:55.820 --> 00:07:56.620
﻿Sheryl...

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:58.720
﻿Are you there?

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:01.540
﻿I'm coming in.

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:07.740
﻿What is it?

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:12.300
I just wanted to see you.

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:13.590
What, me?

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:14.460
Something wrong with that?

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:20.300
Would you mind pouring me a drink?

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:24.550
Aren't you on standby?

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:26.760
Bes will get mad at you.

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:30.240
They're saying this is our last chance to rest.

00:08:30.880 --> 00:08:32.000
It's fine.

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:35.680
After this final battle, where do we run to?

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:37.280
﻿To the plane of karma...

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:40.240
The end of the universe, that is.

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:45.650
﻿Maybe we can escape fate itself.

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:48.080
Do you think so?

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:52.260
If not, the Ideon's battles have all been in vain.

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:54.870
You're right...

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:03.410
﻿Lin...

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:08.420
I never acted like a sister should...

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:21.370
﻿They're most likely hiding on this planet.

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:23.300
Find them no matter what!

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:31.750
﻿That hurt.

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:35.200
"That hurt"? What are those two doing?

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:37.180
﻿And now the other side.

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:40.640
Oh, Kasha! Aren't you going to rest?

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:42.680
﻿You should sleep at least a little.

00:09:43.260 --> 00:09:44.430
﻿Yeah, sure...

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:47.300
We've got some more time to relax.

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:49.020
﻿She's still young.

00:09:50.310 --> 00:09:51.150
Is that so?

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:53.820
﻿You're good at this.

00:09:57.740 --> 00:09:59.190
I brought the spare computer.

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:00.700
Thanks.

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:05.080
What's up?

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:07.790
﻿She's cleaning his ears.

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:09.420
They're taking this easy!

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:11.580
You'd better sleep...

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:46.130
﻿Why are we doing this, Kasha?

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:55.670
You'd better stop.

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:59.080
Is that all you have to say?

00:11:00.450 --> 00:11:03.540
﻿I'm not good at this sort of thing...

00:11:04.550 --> 00:11:07.410
﻿Yeah, that's right...

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:09.080
﻿I love you, Gije.

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:11.810
﻿But...

00:11:12.600 --> 00:11:17.230
This all started with the search
﻿for the Ide on Logo Dau.

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:19.940
﻿Tell me...

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:21.860
﻿Why did it have to turn out like this?

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:26.120
﻿Why do we have to wander
around the universe like fools?

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:29.580
We didn't hate each other!

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:33.710
On the contrary, we ended up loving each other!

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:35.840
﻿Earth, and Buff Clan...

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:39.170
﻿Tell me!

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:44.500
It's the Ide's test.

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:49.060
﻿The Ide must be testing us humanity.

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:51.600
﻿How was killing Lin a test?!

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:53.100
That can't be true!

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:54.980
Is the Ide that high and mighty?!

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:57.730
﻿Not even a God should do this!

00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:00.320
﻿Sheryl...

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:29.470
﻿Lin...

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:32.430
﻿There's a lot of them!

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:34.100
﻿All hands, get to primary battle positions!

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:35.100
﻿What type is that?

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:35.840
They're Adigos!

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:37.060
Where's Cosmo?

00:12:37.060 --> 00:12:38.310
﻿He's in the cockpit.

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:39.360
﻿Good luck!

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:43.360
Prepare for anti-aircraft fire!

00:12:44.030 --> 00:12:44.950
I'm late!

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:46.720
Don't worry, the engine has been started.

00:12:48.070 --> 00:12:50.120
﻿Despite our best efforts, they managed to find us.

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:51.020
﻿This’ll be tough!

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:56.280
Keep up the good work.

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:57.560
﻿Were you sleeping here?

00:12:57.590 --> 00:12:58.660
﻿Yes, shouldn't I?

00:12:58.710 --> 00:12:59.420
﻿It doesn't matter.

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:02.050
﻿Ideo-Delta, launching!

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:03.210
﻿What's wrong?

00:13:03.210 --> 00:13:03.880
With what?

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:04.620
Kasha.

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:05.720
Who knows.

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:13.510
﻿Cosmo, did you get any rest?

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:16.160
﻿I slept well... Together with Kasha.

00:13:16.170 --> 00:13:16.940
﻿Oh, really?

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:18.640
Yeah, right!

00:13:18.640 --> 00:13:20.860
Like I would sleep with Cosmo!

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:29.860
﻿Hatari, ﻿have the Solo Ship hide underneath that leaf.

00:13:29.880 --> 00:13:30.530
﻿Roger!

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:44.760
﻿An enemy attack?!

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:46.170
﻿No, we got stuck on the leaf.

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:47.030
Leaf?!

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:54.560
Is this a carnivorous plant?

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:55.560
They're here, Kasha!

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:56.850
12 o'clock, above you!

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:57.480
﻿Roger!

00:13:59.850 --> 00:14:00.980
There's a number of them!

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:02.890
Looks like they know our location!

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:12.530
﻿Okay, we've found them! Don't be hasty!

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:14.400
﻿All units, take your time suppressing them!

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:19.910
﻿Gije! There's a massive amount of them!

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:22.700
I'm prepared! Let's stop the Adigos!

00:14:31.840 --> 00:14:32.600
Got you!

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:42.130
Gije's doing good!

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:44.940
Let's use these sticky leaves to our advantage!

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:55.540
Rear missiles!

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:56.330
Aim well!

00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:56.740
﻿Roger!

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:01.740
Me too!

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:08.290
﻿They're caught!

00:15:08.290 --> 00:15:09.410
﻿Okay, fire!

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:25.810
Try not to fall on those leaves!

00:15:25.830 --> 00:15:26.730
﻿That's my intention!

00:15:28.380 --> 00:15:29.860
﻿This is the Solo Ship's position...

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:32.990
﻿And these glowing red
﻿dots are all enemy warships?

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:34.490
That's right.

00:15:34.490 --> 00:15:36.910
Can this really be accurate?

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:38.950
Of course it is.

00:15:39.040 --> 00:15:40.930
It wouldn't be much of a radar otherwise.

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:45.620
If that's true, why won't they attack us all at once?

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:49.540
Seems like they're waiting for
 reinforcements before the attack.

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:53.290
In that case,﻿ we can’t
 stick around here.

00:15:53.720 --> 00:15:57.500
﻿We'd better deal with the enemies
 in front of us, then escape from this planet.

00:15:58.140 --> 00:15:58.850
﻿Okay!

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:01.210
﻿Solo Ship, advance! Let's ﻿go out and attack them!

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:12.640
﻿Is the 126th fleet here yet?

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:14.980
They'll be out of subspace in five minutes.

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:16.490
All right.

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:18.870
Our squad will move to assault formation.

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:25.730
When the 126th fleet arrives, we'll attack
 the Logo Dau ship from both sides!

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:31.960
I was able to see Daram Zuba
 again because of that Giant...

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:35.480
﻿But because of its power, Daram died.

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:42.790
At that time, I wasn't around to see Daram...

00:16:43.600 --> 00:16:48.310
That's my deepest regret.

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:54.900
Don't get too close!

00:16:54.900 --> 00:16:57.440
Try to wear them down from a distance!

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:05.080
﻿Damn those Adigos!

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:06.620
Did they stop chasing us?

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:12.380
﻿Gije! Drag them into those sticky leaves!

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:13.210
﻿That's the plan!

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:21.720
Get back! There's no need to rush!

00:17:24.110 --> 00:17:26.850
They're mocking us with their sheer numbers!

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:32.560
﻿The Logo Dau ship?

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:37.840
﻿Stop the Logo Dau ship from moving!
 Don't let them join up!

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:53.210
﻿Gije...

00:17:54.210 --> 00:17:55.010
﻿Gije!

00:17:59.010 --> 00:17:59.750
﻿Damnit!

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:00.540
﻿They got us!

00:18:02.230 --> 00:18:03.700
Where's Kasha?!

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:07.350
I'll crash into them!

00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:08.040
Do it!

00:18:12.440 --> 00:18:15.390
﻿Concentrate fire on the
Giant part that got stuck!

00:18:22.490 --> 00:18:24.390
﻿They destroyed the barrier!

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:29.830
﻿We’re falling!

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:31.710
﻿Gije! The controls!

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:34.590
﻿That's right, the missiles!

00:18:44.740 --> 00:18:45.810
﻿What is this glow?!

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:48.730
﻿The gauge!

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:49.190
﻿What is it?!

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:09.500
﻿The Ideon Sword?

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:40.030
Is this...

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:43.820
﻿The manifestation of the Ide?

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:02.010
Lady Harulu! The 126th Fleet has arrived!

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:05.670
All right! Order the Heavy Mobile
 Mecha to launch immediately!

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:15.540
﻿Make an emergency escape!

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:16.730
﻿Escape!

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:36.400
﻿What is this light?!

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:38.200
﻿This glow!

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:56.210
An entire planet is falling apart...

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:04.070
﻿Escape into subspace!

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:05.770
It's dangerous to stay here!

00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:14.710
Short DS Drive, start! We're escaping!

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:52.870
﻿Don't come here!

00:21:52.870 --> 00:21:53.660
Now's not the time!

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:54.870
﻿But...

00:21:54.870 --> 00:21:56.750
It's better if you don't see this.

00:21:56.750 --> 00:21:57.580
﻿It's horrible.

00:21:58.040 --> 00:21:59.800
﻿Let them take care of it, Karala.

00:22:00.210 --> 00:22:00.960
﻿But...

00:22:00.960 --> 00:22:01.580
﻿Gije?

00:22:01.790 --> 00:22:02.750
Gije?!

00:22:02.750 --> 00:22:05.700
﻿No, you can't let Sheryl in right now!

00:22:06.340 --> 00:22:07.470
﻿Why can't I go?!

00:22:07.470 --> 00:22:08.130
﻿Why!?

00:22:08.130 --> 00:22:08.930
﻿Sheryl!

00:22:08.930 --> 00:22:10.470
You can see him in a moment!

00:22:10.470 --> 00:22:12.050
﻿Don't try to stop me, then!

00:22:12.050 --> 00:22:14.060
﻿Why are you stopping me?

00:22:14.060 --> 00:22:15.720
﻿He's my Gije!

00:22:15.720 --> 00:22:18.260
﻿Why can't I see him? Let me go!

00:22:18.360 --> 00:22:22.530
﻿Let me see him, just for a bit! Let me see Gije!

00:22:22.710 --> 00:22:23.610
﻿Sheryl!

00:22:23.610 --> 00:22:25.400
﻿Why...

00:22:26.070 --> 00:22:28.370
﻿Why does every person dear to me...

00:22:28.900 --> 00:22:30.700
have to die?!

00:22:31.320 --> 00:22:33.330
﻿Gije!

00:22:38.080 --> 00:22:39.080
﻿Solo Ship...

00:22:40.500 --> 00:22:42.380
﻿The Space Runaway...

00:22:50.340 --> 00:22:54.850
﻿The awakened power of Ide reunites
 Karala with her father, Doba.

00:22:55.680 --> 00:22:59.360
﻿The Ide gives the people one final chance.

00:22:59.810 --> 00:23:05.430
﻿However, the hatred in Doba's heart
 brings forth the true manifestation of Ide.

00:23:05.690 --> 00:23:09.730
﻿The Ide roars, shining like a second Big Bang.

00:23:10.820 --> 00:23:13.570
﻿Legendary Giant Ideon, Final Episode:

00:23:13.090 --> 00:23:18.360
<b>I﻿n the Cosmos With You</b>

